{"seq":3,"slug":"ethics-politics","title":"伦理与政治：信息权力的规范","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/philosophy-logic/philosophy-of-information/ethics-politics","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"information-ethics","title":"信息伦理学：信息圈与道德责任","url":"/l-doc-books/h/philosophy-logic/philosophy-of-information/ethics-politics/information-ethics","wordCount":876,"readingTime":4},{"seq":2,"slug":"privacy-surveillance","title":"隐私与监控：信息自决权的哲学基础","url":"/l-doc-books/h/philosophy-logic/philosophy-of-information/ethics-politics/privacy-surveillance","wordCount":945,"readingTime":4},{"seq":3,"slug":"algorithmic-governance","title":"算法治理：透明性、可解释性与问责制","url":"/l-doc-books/h/philosophy-logic/philosophy-of-information/ethics-politics/algorithmic-governance","wordCount":993,"readingTime":4}],"introHtml":"<h1 id=\"伦理与政治-信息权力的规范\">伦理与政治：信息权力的规范</h1><p>本章从哲学视角审视信息社会的伦理与政治问题：信息伦理的基础框架、隐私与监控的哲学争论、以及算法治理的合法性挑战。</p>\n<h2 id=\"本章文档\">本章文档</h2><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>文档</th>\n<th>主题</th>\n<th>核心概念</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><a href=\"information-ethics\">信息伦理学</a></td>\n<td>Floridi 的 IE 框架</td>\n<td>信息圈、道德患者、信息代理</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"privacy-surveillance\">隐私与监控</a></td>\n<td>监控资本主义与信息自决</td>\n<td>Zuboff 框架、差分隐私哲学</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"algorithmic-governance\">算法治理</a></td>\n<td>算法决策的合法性</td>\n<td>AIA 三原则、可解释性争论</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"章节定位\">章节定位</h2><p>程序员在设计系统时面临真实的伦理责任。本章提供思考框架，而非具体规范。理解信息伦理的哲学基础，有助于在技术决策中辨别深层价值冲突，而非仅遵循合规清单。</p>\n"}